      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2 / PrepareActivation：只生成提案，不广播\n核对实际 manifest、runtime hash 与固定绑定\n16 + token数量 项激活 calldata\n登记 Treasury/Clearing/Quarantine/Cold\n明确路由 + 各资产额度，最后恢复路由\n默认走 Clearing；直达 Treasury 归集默认关闭",
      "originalText": "2 / PrepareActivation：只生成提案，不广播\n核对实际 manifest、runtime hash 与固定绑定\n16 + token数量 项激活 calldata\n登记 Treasury/Clearing/Quarantine/Cold\n明确路由 + 各资产额度，最后恢复路由\n默认走 Clearing；直达 Treasury 归集默认关闭",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-prepare",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
