      "text": "3 / Council → TenantTimelock\nscheduleBatch → 等待至少两天 → executeBatch\n原子执行：登记、路由、额度、恢复\n等待期提案改变须重新排队\nTimelock 禁止把 delay 降到两天以下\n后台按真实治理收据和最终状态验收",
      "originalText": "3 / Council → TenantTimelock\nscheduleBatch → 等待至少两天 → executeBatch\n原子执行：登记、路由、额度、恢复\n等待期提案改变须重新排队\nTimelock 禁止把 delay 降到两天以下\n后台按真实治理收据和最终状态验收",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-activate",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
