      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8 / Cold.returnToTreasury\nkind = Rebalance；目标登记 Treasury\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council 每笔必需\nDomain = Milon Cold / 1\n任何金额都需要独立离线共同批准",
      "originalText": "8 / Cold.returnToTreasury\nkind = Rebalance；目标登记 Treasury\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council 每笔必需\nDomain = Milon Cold / 1\n任何金额都需要独立离线共同批准",
