      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "10 / 精确回款 + ColdReturned\n消费 operationId / 转账同事务\n失败全部回滚，授权仍可能有效\n规范链最终事件与状态核对\nPG 更新 movement / Outbox",
