    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-back-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 174.0,
      "y": 1178.75,
      "width": 252,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3323733,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "11 / 返回登记 Treasury\n为本租户提供已批准流动性\n用户总负债不变化\n双向调拨分别消费共享预算\n不能把链上预留当作可支付资本",
      "originalText": "11 / 返回登记 Treasury\n为本租户提供已批准流动性\n用户总负债不变化\n双向调拨分别消费共享预算\n不能把链上预留当作可支付资本",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-back",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-emergency",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3381993,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-emergency-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-emergency-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 231.0,
      "y": 1740.0,
      "width": 378.0,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3865551,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Guardian 即时收紧 / 暂停\nHOLD、SECURITY_PAUSED、提高 reserve\nsetRoutesPaused(true)、tightenLimits\n撤销 executor / 停用 asset\n不能解除 HOLD、降 reserve 或恢复路由。\n重要：routesPaused 只拦需 route 的移动，\n不阻断 Treasury.executeWithdrawal。\n全面停止提现须用相应风险控制/额度。",
      "originalText": "Guardian 即时收紧 / 暂停\nHOLD、SECURITY_PAUSED、提高 reserve\nsetRoutesPaused(true)、tightenLimits\n撤销 executor / 停用 asset\n不能解除 HOLD、降 reserve 或恢复路由。\n重要：routesPaused 只拦需 route 的移动，\n不阻断 Treasury.executeWithdrawal。\n全面停止提现须用相应风险控制/额度。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-emergency",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-governance",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3483948,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-governance-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-governance-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1021.55,
      "y": 1740.0,
      "width": 396.9,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3967506,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Council / Timelock 的变更权限\nCouncil：逐案 releaseHold、减少 reserve、\n专项处置与必要共同签名。\nTimelock：角色/额度/资产/池登记、路由修改、\nSECURITY_PAUSED 恢复；延迟至少两天。\n改路由前先暂停，修改后 routeEpoch 增加；\n扩权和恢复不走 Guardian 在线捷径。\nsigner/asset/policy 改变撤销相应旧授权。",
      "originalText": "Council / Timelock 的变更权限\nCouncil：逐案 releaseHold、减少 reserve、\n专项处置与必要共同签名。\nTimelock：角色/额度/资产/池登记、路由修改、\nSECURITY_PAUSED 恢复；延迟至少两天。\n改路由前先暂停，修改后 routeEpoch 增加；\n扩权和恢复不走 Guardian 在线捷径。\nsigner/asset/policy 改变撤销相应旧授权。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-governance",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-migration",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1630,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3392674,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-migration-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-08-custody-governance-migration-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1763.05,
      "y": 1740.0,
      "width": 513.9,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3876232,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "同租户版本迁移（规划 + 合约）\n先终结旧池在途授权并最终对账。\nTreasury.transferCustody(kind=Migration)：\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council，仍检查风险/预算。\nClearing.settle 到 Clearing：Council，保留 maturity。\n新 Treasury 不继承旧 requestId 去重映射。\nCold/Quarantine 无普通 Migration 路由。\n旧地址持续监听；不依赖销毁后原址升级。",
      "originalText": "同租户版本迁移（规划 + 合约）\n先终结旧池在途授权并最终对账。\nTreasury.transferCustody(kind=Migration)：\nTRANSFER_SIGNER + Council，仍检查风险/预算。\nClearing.settle 到 Clearing：Council，保留 maturity。\n新 Treasury 不继承旧 requestId 去重映射。\nCold/Quarantine 无普通 Migration 路由。\n旧地址持续监听；不依赖销毁后原址升级。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-08-custody-governance-migration",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
